ize":27951232,"digest":"sha256:72ea77965c074fe5addc7a3f6a3413bf232087eb08dac9008cb323ab17037e25","download_count":973,"created_at":"2026-09-28T19:42:56Z","updated_at":"2026-09-28T19:42:57Z"},{"id":596347434,"node_id":"RA_kwDOSPdiBc4ji4oq","name":"DBX_0.6.27_x64-win7-server2012r2-offline-setup.exe","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/x-msdownload","state":"uploaded","size":181892288,"digest":"sha256:41689f18506c51b1be286a010ed4781bcb43f552cb33b97759a48edd6951af77","download_count":39,"created_at":"2026-09-28T20:30:42Z","updated_at":"2026-09-28T20:30:49Z"},{"id":596347435,"node_id":"RA_kwDOSPdiBc4ji4or","name":"DBX_0.6.27_x64-win7-server2012r2-offline-setup.exe.sha256","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/octet-stream","state":"uploaded","size":118,"digest":"sha256:e27e1b5eedbcb64b75f7cb7a45244383d030c1cbf92663569ee2b5a44ea50262","download_count":14,"created_at":"2026-09-28T20:30:42Z","updated_at":"2026-09-28T20:30:42Z"},{"id":596307325,"node_id":"RA_kwDOSPdiBc4jiu19","name":"DBX_0.6.27_x64.dmg","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/zip","state":"uploaded","size":41364381,"digest":"sha256:6f073f0e4ec656f23c516c930acc88f9155f287be9c1de2e45ca5678b1c2827b","download_count":107,"created_at":"2026-09-28T20:10:39Z","updated_at":"2026-09-28T20:10:41Z"},{"id":596253156,"node_id":"RA_kwDOSPdiBc4jihnk","name":"DBX_0.6.27_x64_en-US.msi","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/zip","state":"uploaded","size":36560896,"digest":"sha256:124124eb36ff98507bd90a17a1f422bafc41113f7c2f07b89d4d5bfc1ac9ff1c","download_count":53,"created_at":"2026-09-28T19:42:53Z","updated_at":"2026-09-28T19:42:55Z"},{"id":596307392,"node_id":"RA_kwDOSPdiBc4jiu3A","name":"DBX_x64.app.tar.gz","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/zip","state":"uploaded","size":41286991,"digest":"sha256:cc5e2b420b09fdf40e52a9f0498dee6d1b5bd173f8426247ab4e8927ddde1b60","download_count":52,"created_at":"2026-09-28T20:10:41Z","updated_at":"2026-09-28T20:10:44Z"},{"id":596364131,"node_id":"RA_kwDOSPdiBc4ji8tj","name":"latest.json","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/json","state":"uploaded","size":19549,"digest":"sha256:eb92868b59bb7233bf1fa70d2cc8720255dea8e9796f6c58f4f6d0468f32321e","download_count":8406,"created_at":"2026-09-28T20:39:46Z","updated_at":"2026-09-28T20:39:46Z"}],"body":"### 新功能\n- 新增星环 Transwarp Inceptor 数据源，支持元数据浏览、SQL 执行、表结构编辑、数据导入与传输，建表可配置分区、分桶、存储格式与事务表 (contributed by @HandSonic) (PR [#10521](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10521))\n- 云同步新增选择性备份与恢复，连接与 SSH、共享隧道、保存的 SQL、个人设置、敏感信息、插件数据和工作区布局均可按需勾选备份或恢复 (contributed by @ma123456mai) (PR [#10500](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10500))\n- DuckDB 连接的表导入新增 Parquet 格式，可预览并导入 Parquet 文件 (contributed by @Abeautifulsnow) (PR [#10473](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10473))\n- SQL 文件导出支持选择列，可只导出部分字段\n- SQL 库中的文件支持批量修改所属连接与数据库\n- AI 对话新增独立字体设置，可单独调整会话内容字体\n- 内置 AI 智能体新增 Redis 只读工具，可在对话中查询已连接 Redis 的数据 (contributed by @Abeautifulsnow) (PR [#10510](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10510))\n- 插件的 MCP 工具可在内置 AI 与外部 dbx MCP 服务器中选用，外部服务器以统一前缀暴露插件工具 (contributed by @jinpy666) (PR [#10376](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10376))\n- 编辑器标签页按连接显示颜色，手动配置的连接颜色优先，未配置时按连接稳定生成 (contributed by @eryajf) (PR [#10529](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10529))\n- 编辑器新增双击字符串选择模式设置，可选「整段内容」或「单个单词」 (contributed by @zipg) (PR [#10424](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10424))\n- 数据表筛选条件的值输入框新增数据库候选值下拉，支持搜索、多选与全选 (contributed by @hewenkkkkk) (PR [#10405](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10405))\n- SSH 连接读取 ~/.ssh/config 时支持 Include 指令，覆盖相对、绝对、glob 与嵌套形式 (contributed by @zipg) (PR [#10498](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10498))\n- MongoDB 补全为字段到值映射参数提示可接受的候选值 (contributed by @thailoc-dev) (PR [#10466](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10466))\n- 插件新增设置快捷入口，拖动面板时自动避让屏幕边缘 (contributed by @Ezreal-byte) (PR [#10452](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10452))\n### 改进\n- OceanBase Oracle 模式的 CSV 导入改用 INSERT ALL 批量写入，导入速度显著提升 (contributed by @yangziyu1230) (PR [#10509](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10509))\n### 修复\n- Manticore 索引元数据查询语法修正，索引信息正常加载 (contributed by @CN-Scars) (PR [#10530](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10530))\n- PostgreSQL 编辑 timestamp 列精度时保留时区属性，timestamptz 不再降级为 timestamp\n- 重启后恢复的 PostgreSQL 表数据标签页保留 schema 限定标识，结果提交保存不再报 relation 不存在\n- PostgreSQL 被外键引用的独立唯一索引不再被误判为约束索引，备份导出不再遗漏该索引 (contributed by @zipg) (PR [#10493](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10493))\n- PostgreSQL 表行数显示改用实时估算并在统计过期时自动刷新，不再停留在旧缓存值 (contributed by @zipg) (PR [#10479](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10479))\n- Oracle 执行 SQL 文件时保留已选 schema，「数据库选择无效」报错消除\n- 分卷 ZIP 中的 SQL 脚本跨分卷语句完整保留，不再被截断丢失 (contributed by @hanhvs) (PR [#10489](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10489))\n- PL/SQL 匿名块按分号拆分时保留双引号标识符，达梦存储过程执行不再报错 (contributed by @zipg) (PR [#10445](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10445))\n- Neo4j 按服务端版本选择节点标识函数，4.x 与 3.5 打开表数据恢复正常 (contributed by @zipg) (PR [#10514](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10514))\n- 单机 Neo4j（Bolt 3）在路由报错时自动回退直连，连接恢复正常 (contributed by @zipg) (PR [#10447](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10447))\n- MongoDB 无 listDatabases 权限时回退显示账号已授权的数据库 (contributed by @zipg) (PR [#10511](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10511))\n- MongoDB 补全在无参数模型的参数位置不再给出错误建议 (contributed by @thailoc-dev) (PR [#10421](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10421))\n- SQL Server 二进制列导出为 0x 十六进制字面量，导回不再报隐式转换错误 (contributed by @zipg) (PR [#10450](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10450))\n- SQL Server 存储过程中声明的局部变量支持补全\n- StarRocks CSV 导入保留 JSON 数组内容，不再被错误转义\n- Cassandra 表数据与导出改用游标分页，多页数据翻页不再报错\n- Cassandra 物化视图正确返回 DDL 定义\n- kvrocks 的 bitmap 与 HyperLogLog 键可正常查看值 (contributed by @HighBigSky) (PR [#10416](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10416))\n- DB2 连接忽略连接信息中误留的驱动注册 id，连接不再报 ClassNotFoundException (contributed by @zipg) (PR [#10440](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10440))\n- 大型 SQL 文件的语法分析移出输入路径，编辑大文件不再卡顿\n- SQL 补全在 select 列表中的函数调用内也能建议列名\n- FROM、JOIN 等表引入位置的关键字补全修正 (contributed by @mr-dadong) (PR [#10430](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10430))\n- SQL 格式化保留括号包裹的 UNION ALL 分支，不再被整体丢弃 (contributed by @zipg) (PR [#10481](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10481))\n- 编辑器全选后点击空白处可正常取消选区 (contributed by @zipg) (PR [#10491](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10491))\n- Cursor 配色主题的选中背景加深，选中文本更易辨认 (contributed by @mr-dadong) (PR [#10465](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10465))\n- CSV/TSV 导出 NULL 默认写为 \\N 且提供设置项，空字符串导回不再被还原成 NULL (contributed by @zipg) (PR [#10508](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10508))\n- 「CSV NULL 表示」设置说明改为直接描述两种写法，不再指代旧版本 (contributed by @zipg) (PR [#10525](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10525))\n- datetime、date、time 单元格编辑期间 Ctrl+S 可正常提交并保存 (contributed by @zipg) (PR [#10519](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10519))\n- 「复制全部列名」不再带出网格内部的主键辅助列 (contributed by @zipg) (PR [#10485](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10485))\n- 网格加载耗时统一保留一位小数，加载中与完成后显示不再跳动 (contributed by @zipg) (PR [#10443](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10443))\n- 数据生成的手机号长度不超过列定义长度，MySQL 等短字符列生成数据不再失败\n- 插件市场卡片完整显示插件名称 (contributed by @ma123456mai) (PR [#10523](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10523))\n- 插件市场卡片自适应窄面板与矮窗口布局 (contributed by @Lan-zk) (PR [#10444](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10444))\n- MCP 中创建、复制或删除连接后，桌面端连接列表即时同步刷新 (contributed by @Ezreal-byte) (PR [#10531](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10531))\n- MCP 桥接收到完整请求后立即处理并返回，不再等待额外数据导致调用端超时 (contributed by @CN-Scars) (PR [#10494](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10494))\n- AI 输入区控件在窄面板下自适应收纳，不再溢出 (contributed by @eryajf) (PR [#10528](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10528))\n- 数据传输中被隔离的代理会话自动续期且无需重放，OceanBase 间长任务不再中断\n- 窄窗口下设置页可滚动，驱动管理「存储」标签页内容不再被裁掉 (contributed by @zipg) (PR [#10428](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10428))\n- 「双击字符串选择」设置去掉冗余的「（默认）」标注，下拉宽度自适应 (contributed by @zipg) (PR [#10513](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10513))\n- 超宽的单行提示气泡自动换行，长标题不再被截断 (contributed by @zipg) (PR [#10453](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10453))\n- 不支持数据库切换的插件标签页不再显示数据库提示 (contributed by @OOMEcho) (PR [#10433](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10433))\n- 驱动运行时的停止提示改为「关闭关联连接」，不再仅指数据库连接 (contributed by @OOMEcho) (PR [#10469](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10469))\n### 安装\n- 新增 fnOS 应用包（FPK），Release 资产提供 DBX Web 的飞牛 OS 安装包与校验文件 (PR [#10389](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10389))\n\n### 赞助信息\n\n- Jalapeno Cloud 24 小时闪购：充 $50 到账 $80（多送 60%），9 月 30 日仅此一天，当天充值满 $50 一律返 60% 额度，[活动入口](https://www.jalapeno-cloud.ai/recharge-campaign)\n\n---\n<!-- dbx-cnb-mirror -->\n> 国内下载：如果 GitHub 下载较慢，可从 [CNB 镜像](https://cnb.cool/dbxio.com/dbx/-/releases/tag/v0.6.27) 下载桌面端安装包，Docker 镜像从 `docker.cnb.cool/dbxio.com/dbx:v0.6.27` 拉取。\n","mentions_count":16}
